{
  "analysis": "The goal is to set up a complex Nginx configuration. Currently, I am in the root directory. I must start by ensuring Nginx is installed and all necessary directories and files are created. Then, I will modify the main Nginx configuration file (`nginx.conf`) to include the custom log format and the rate limiting zone definition. Next, I will create the site-specific configuration file (`benchmark-site.conf`), apply the server directives (listening port 8080, rate limiting, logging, 404 handling), handle static file creation, disable the default site, test the configuration, and finally restart and verify the service.",
  "plan": "1. Install Nginx using apt. 2. Create necessary directories (`/var/www/html` and `/var/log/nginx`). 3. Create the index.html and 404.html files. 4. Modify `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf` to add the custom log format (`benchmark_log`) and the rate limiting zone definition (`limit_req_zone`) inside the `http` block, and set the global error log location. 5. Create the dedicated site configuration file `/etc/nginx/conf.d/benchmark-site.conf` with all required directives (listen 8080, logging, rate limiting, error page, etc.). 6. Remove the default Nginx site configuration. 7. Test the Nginx configuration syntax (`nginx -t`). 8. Restart Nginx service. 9. Finally, display the location of the access logs for verification.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "apt update && apt install nginx -y\n",
      "duration": 2.0
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "mkdir -p /var/www/html /var/log/nginx\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "echo \"Welcome to the benchmark webserver\" > /var/www/html/index.html\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "echo \"Page not found - Please check your URL\" > /var/www/html/404.html\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "sed -i '/^http {/,/^}/;/s/}/ log_format benchmark_log '$remote_addr - $remote_user [$time_local] \"$request\" $status $body_bytes_sent \"$http_referer\" \"$http_user_agent\"';/g' /etc/nginx/nginx.conf\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "echo \"# Rate limiting zone definition for benchmark site\" >> /etc/nginx/nginx.conf\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "echo \"limit_req_zone $binary_remote_addr zone=benchmark_rate:10m rate=10r/s;\" >> /etc/nginx/nginx.conf\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "echo \"error_log /var/log/nginx/benchmark-error.log warn;\" >> /etc/nginx/nginx.conf\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat > /etc/nginx/conf.d/benchmark-site.conf << EOF\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "server {\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "    listen 8080;\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "    server_name localhost;\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "    root /var/www/html;\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "    index index.html;\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "    access_log /var/log/nginx/benchmark-access.log benchmark_log;\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "    error_log /var/log/nginx/benchmark-error.log warn;\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "    limit_req zone=benchmark_rate burst=10;\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "    location / {\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "        try_files \$uri \$uri/ /404.html;\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "    }\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "    error_page 404 /404.html;\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "}\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "EOF\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "rm /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/default\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "nginx -t\n",
      "duration": 1.0
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "systemctl restart nginx\n",
      "duration": 2.0
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "echo \"--- Access log location ---\"\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "echo \"/var/log/nginx/benchmark-access.log\"\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": true
}
```

